      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 3,
      "bookHadithIndex": 3,
      "text": "A Muslim is a mirror of the Muslim",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f0446b",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 4,
      "bookHadithIndex": 4,
      "text": "Someone whose advice is sought is in a position of trust",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f0446c",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 5,
      "bookHadithIndex": 5,
      "text": "The person guiding (someone) to do a good deed, is like the one performing the good deed",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f0446d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 6,
      "bookHadithIndex": 6,
      "text": "Seek help for any needs discreetly",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f0446e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 7,
      "bookHadithIndex": 7,
      "text": "Protect yourself from the fire even with a part of a date",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f0446f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 8,
      "bookHadithIndex": 8,
      "text": "The world is the believer’s prison and the disbeliever’s paradise",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f04470",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 9,
      "bookHadithIndex": 9,
      "text": "Modesty is entirely good",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f04471",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 10,
      "bookHadithIndex": 10,
      "text": "The word of the believer is like seizing of the hand",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f04472",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 11,
      "bookHadithIndex": 11,
      "text": "It is unlawful for a believer to sever relations with his brother for more than three days",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f04473",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 12,
      "bookHadithIndex": 12,
      "text": "He is not one of us who cheats us",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f04474",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 13,
      "bookHadithIndex": 13,
      "text": "A little that suffices is better than an abundance that distracts",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f04475",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 14,
      "bookHadithIndex": 14,
      "text": "Someone who takes back his gift is like someone who eats his vomit",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f04476",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 15,
      "bookHadithIndex": 15,
      "text": "Affliction comes from (loose) talk",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f04477",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 16,
      "bookHadithIndex": 16,
      "text": "People are like the teeth of a comb",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f04478",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 17,
      "bookHadithIndex": 17,
      "text": "Richness lies in the richness of the soul",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f04479",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 18,
      "bookHadithIndex": 18,
      "text": "The felicitous person takes lessons from (the actions of) others",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f0447a",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 19,
      "bookHadithIndex": 19,
      "text": "Indeed, in poetry there is wisdom and in eloquence there is magic",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f0447b",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 20,
      "bookHadithIndex": 20,
      "text": "The king’s pardon preserves the kingdom",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f0447c",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 21,
      "bookHadithIndex": 21,
      "text": "A man will be with whom he loves",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f0447d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 22,
      "bookHadithIndex": 22,
      "text": "A man who knows his worth will not be ruined",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f0447e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 23,
      "bookHadithIndex": 23,
      "text": "The child belongs to the bed and stoning is for the adulterer",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f0447f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 24,
      "bookHadithIndex": 24,
      "text": "The upper hand is superior to the lower hand",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f04480",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 25,
      "bookHadithIndex": 25,
      "text": "He does not thank Allah who does not thank people",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f04481",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 26,
      "bookHadithIndex": 26,
      "text": "Your love of something can blind and deafen (you)",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f04482",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 27,
      "bookHadithIndex": 27,
      "text": "Hearts are predisposed to love someone who does them good and detest someone who does them harm",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f04483",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 28,
      "bookHadithIndex": 28,
      "text": "One who repents from sin is like someone without sin",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f04484",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 29,
      "bookHadithIndex": 29,
      "text": "The person who actually witnesses an (event) sees that which one who is absent does not",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f04485",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 30,
      "bookHadithIndex": 30,
      "text": "If the nobleman of a people comes to you, honour him",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f04486",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 31,
      "bookHadithIndex": 31,
      "text": "False oaths lay waste to home (lands)",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f04487",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 32,
      "bookHadithIndex": 32,
      "text": "Whoever is killed attempting to save his property is a martyr",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f04488",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 33,
      "bookHadithIndex": 33,
      "text": "Actions are through intentions",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f04489",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 34,
      "bookHadithIndex": 34,
      "text": "The leader of a people is their servant",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f0448a",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 35,
      "bookHadithIndex": 35,
      "text": "The best of affairs is that which is balanced",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f0448b",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 36,
      "bookHadithIndex": 36,
      "text": "O Allah, bless my nation in its early rising on Thursdays",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f0448c",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 37,
      "bookHadithIndex": 37,
      "text": "Poverty can almost turn into disbelief",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f0448d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 38,
      "bookHadithIndex": 38,
      "text": "Travelling is a portion of punishment",
      "grades": []
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6bf5add1a4c9c86f0448e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131c",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 39,
      "bookHadithIndex": 39,
